    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Death We Love is a short, 10 to 15 minute black &amp; white hand drawn sidescroller. It\u2019s a dark gothic cinematic adventure reflecting on how every ending makes way for something new. Hopefully inviting you to take a break and reflect on things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a skeletal horse as Death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doom the Lands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regret it all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in a coffee break!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing soundtrack and hand drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by one person so expect love &amp; jank :) I do want to turn this into something bigger at some point so check it out and lmk what you think!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Death We Love is a short, 10 to 15 minute black &amp; white hand drawn sidescroller. It\u2019s a dark gothic cinematic adventure reflecting on how every ending makes way for something new. Hopefully inviting you to take a break and reflect on things.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ride a skeletal horse as Death</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Doom the Lands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Regret it all</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playable in a coffee break!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amazing soundtrack and hand drawn art</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Made by one person so expect love &amp; jank :) I do want to turn this into something bigger at some point so check it out and lmk what you think!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
